<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">YÛD - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Yûd</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yûda</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA GA YÛDA</para>
  <para style="h">MARUBA GA YÛDA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA GA YÛDA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1"/>Yûda, mwambali wa Yezu Kristu, mwene wâbo Yakôbo, oku nshâgi ntonyi muli Nyamuzinda Îshe zalangagwa erhi Yezu orhuma. <verse eid="JUD 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2"/>Obwonjo n’obuholo, n’obuzigire bigandâze muli mwe!<verse eid="JUD 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecirhumire ayandika aga maruba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3"/>Bîra bâni, ene mbà ndwîrhe nalonza okummuyandikira nti mmubwîre ebinwa by’obucire bwîrhu rhweshi, lêro nanacibona nkola ngwâsirwe okummuyandikira nti mmuhanûle lyo mulwîra obuyêmêre abatagatîfu bashobôlaga kwa lwoshi oku caligumiza. <verse eid="JUD 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4"/>Bulya hali abantu bammushesherîremwo bufunda-funda; balya batwîrîrwe olubanja kurhenga mîra: eyo mihera ekahindula engalo ya Nyamuzinda wîrhu eyijire masîma ga mubiri, ekâhakana Nnâhamwîrhu muguma yêne na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abîgîriza b’obunywesi n’obuhane bânahâbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5"/>Ciru akabà mwayigîrizîbwe ebyo byoshi caligumiza, nnonzize okummukengêza oku Nyakasane, erhi abà amalîkûza olubaga lwâge amanalurhenza omu cihugo c’e Mîsiri, enyuma ly’aho aherêrekeza ababulaga bwayêmêra. <verse eid="JUD 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6"/>Nabo bamalahika babulaga okukenga obukulu bwâbo, ci barhenga aha mwâbo, abahizire omu nkoba z’omwizimya gw’ensiku n’amango, mpu balingire­mwo olubanja lw’Olusiku lukulu. <verse eid="JUD 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7"/>Sodomo na Gomora n’ebishagala by’eburhambi kwo na kwo: nabo bagwîra okuhusha n’okushimba ebiremwa birhali bya bwôrhere buguma n’obwâbo, bahinduka lwîganyo lw’obuhane bw’omuliro gw’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="JUD 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8"/>Abo bantu nabo kwo na kuguma: omu isirhe lyâbo, banakâsherêza emibiri yâbo, bagayaguze obukulu bwa Nyakasane, banalogorhere ebiremwa by’irenge. <verse eid="JUD 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9"/>Malahika mukulu Mikaheli erhi ajîsa shetani mbaka anamujîsa kadali oku mubiri gwa Mûsa, arhaderhaga mpu akamubwîra akanwa k’okumulogorhera, ci anaciderha, erhi: «Nyakasane akuhane!» <verse eid="JUD 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10"/>Ci bôhe banajâcire ebi barhamanyiri, n’ebi bayishi n’obwôrhere bwâbo bw’ecinya-mubiri kula ensimba zirhajira bukengêre zinayôrha, biri bya kubaherêrekeza. <verse eid="JUD 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11"/>Bali bahanya! bulya bàshimbire enjira ya Kayini, bacîyôha omu kuhabuka kwa Balaamu erhi kulonz’iyunguka kurhuma, bàhungumukira omu bugoma bwa Korè. <verse eid="JUD 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12"/>Abo bantu bo bakâzinza amadinye ginyu g’ecinyabuguma. Nka balya, barhabà nshonyi, na ntà cindi bakengêra okurhali kuyunjuza amada gâbo. Kwo bali nka bitù birhalimwo nkuba bidwîrhe byayehûlwa n’empûsi; eri mirhi ya canda erhalikwo malehe, efîre kabiri enakundusire! <verse eid="JUD 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13"/>Eri mivumba mikali y’omu nyanja edwîrhe yarhengamwo omufula gw’enshonyi zâyo; ziri nyenyêzi zihabusire zidwîrhe zalingwa na nyandumà w’ensiku n’amango! <verse eid="JUD 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14"/>Ka­ndi bo Henoki, shakulûza wa kali-nda kurhenga Adamu, alêbaga erhi aderha, erhi: <char style="qt">«Loli oku Nyakasane ayishire n’ebihumbi n’ebihumbi by’abatagatîfu bâge</char>, <verse eid="JUD 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15"/><char style="qt">mpu atwîre abantu boshi olubanja, anayagîrize emihera yoshi oku bijiro bibî bàkozire n’oku binwa by’ebijâci abo banya-byâha b’emihera bamuderhîre</char>». <verse eid="JUD 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16"/>Babà bantu bakâyôrha bacîduduma, ntà mango basîma, emunda iralà libahesire yo banajà, omu kanwa kâbo nderho za bucîbone zirhengamwo, banakalimîriza abantu mpu babarhôlekwo obunguke.<verse eid="JUD 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahanûla abemêzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17"/>Ci mwêhe, bîra bâni, mukengêre ebinwa byalêbagwa n’entumwa za Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="JUD 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18"/>Ka barhammubwîraga oku omu nsiku nzinda hayish’ibà abantu basîma okugayaguza abâbo, abakashimba iralà ly’obubî bwâbo? <verse eid="JUD 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19"/>Bâbo bo bakammulerhamwo okucîberûlamwo, bantu bashimba obwôrhere bwâbo bw’ecinya-mubiri, Mûka Mutagatîfu arhababâmwo.<verse eid="JUD 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhegeko ly’obuzigire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20"/>Ci mwêhe, bazigirwa bâni, musimbane omu bûbake buyûbasirwe oku ciriba c’obuyêmêre bwinyu butagatîfu lwoshi, mushenge muli Mûka Mutagatîfu <verse eid="JUD 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21"/>munabêre omu buzigire bwa Nnâmahanga, muyôrhe mucîrheganyize okuyankirira olukogo lwa Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, omu buzîne bw’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="JUD 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22"/>Abadwîrhe barhindira, mubarhabâle bayêmêre; <verse eid="JUD 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23"/>abandi, mubacize, mubayôkole omu muliro; abandi bôhe mubafe bwonjo, ci erhi munayôbohire, mugaye ciru n’omwambalo guzinzîbwe n’omubiri gwâbo.<verse eid="JUD 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irenge kuli Nyamuzinda emyâka n’emyâka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24"/>Ayâgirwe Olya ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okummulanga murhahirime n’okumuyîmanza embere z’irenge lyâge buzira izâbyo omu bushagaluke! <verse eid="JUD 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25"/>Kuli oyo Nyamuzinda muguma yêne, Muciza wîrhu, oku bulagizi bwa Yezu Kristu Nnâhamwîrhu, irenge, obukuze, oburhegesi n’obuhashe, kurhenga embere igulu liremwe, na buno, n’emyâka n’emyâka! Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1"/>
</usx>
